====Verb====
{{en-verb|buses|busing|bused|pres_3sg2=busses|pres_ptc2=bussing|past2=bussed}}

# {{lb|en|transitive|automotive|transport}} To [[transport]] via a motor bus.
#* {{quote-book
|en
|year=1999
|author=w:Michael Saso
|title=Velvet Bonds: The Chinese Family
|url=https://archive.org/details/velvetbonds00mich/
|ISBN=1-929431-00-7
|OCLC=248283109
|OL=12299411M
|page=ix
|pageurl=https://archive.org/details/velvetbonds00mich/page/n10/
|text=Because the new language school of Fu Jen University in the nearby city of Hsinchu was not yet completed, we were '''bused''' with other aspiring students of Chinese language to a farming village called Kuanhsi (Guanxi: West Pass), nestled against the tea growing hills of Hsinchu county.}}
#* {{quote-web|en|author=Clive Ndou|work={{w|The Witness (newspaper)|The Witness}}|date=2024-03-14|url=https://witness.co.za/news/kzn/2024/03/14/anc-set-to-open-case-against-ghost-ifp-voters/|title=ANC set to open case against ‘ghost IFP voters’|passage=The ANC has accused the IFP of '''bussing''' in voters from other wards to vote during the recent Newcastle Municipality by-election won by the IFP.|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20260210132454/https://witness.co.za/news/kzn/2024/03/14/anc-set-to-open-case-against-ghost-ifp-voters/}}
# {{lb|en|transitive|automotive|transport|chiefly|US}} To transport students to school, often to a more distant school for the purposes of achieving racial integration.
#* {{quote-song|en|year=1966|author=Phil Ochs|title=Love Me, I'm a Liberal|album=Phils Ochs in Concert
|passage=But if you ask me to '''bus''' my children / I hope the cops take down your name}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2008|author=Ashley R. Holm|title=Racial Differences in Student Engagement and Attainment: A Study of Topeka High School, 1939--1984|publisher=ProQuest|isbn=9780549750758|page=23
|passage=...to strike down Detroit&#39;s federal court order to '''bus''' students across school district lines for the purpose of desegregation and therefore nullify many busing programs throughout the country.}}
# {{lb|en|intransitive|automotive|transport}} To [[travel]] by bus.

=====Usage notes=====
The ''{{w|Canadian Oxford Dictionary}}'' only presents the spellings {{m|en|buses}}, {{m|en|busing}}, and {{m|en|bused}}, implying that these are the preferred forms in Canada.

